  "title": "Nebraska National Guard supports local law enforcement with tornado response",
  "description": "Nebraska National Guard Soldiers and Airmen and the Nebraska State Patrol support the Douglas County Sherrif’s Office with traffic control points, May 3, 2024, in the Woodlands Crossing neighborhood of Bennington, Nebraska. Eighty-two Soldiers and Airmen volunteered for state active duty to integrate with local law enforcement at designated areas in Douglas County that were significantly impacted by the Arbor Day tornadoes on April 26, 2024. The Soldiers and Airmen are working in rotating shifts providing controlled vehicle access and conducting roving patrols to ensure the safety and well-being of all within the affected areas. (U.S. Air National Guard video by Staff Sgt. Alexander D. Schriner)",
